.
.  Generate a dex interaction effects matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na dexint3.ps
device 2 postscript
device 1 font simplex
.
SKIP 50
read JAHANMI2.DAT run lab bar set y x1 to x8 batch
let y1 = y
let y2 = y
retain y1 subset batch 1
retain y2 subset batch 2
skip 0
.
. Generate Matrix of Dex Interaction Effects
.
multiplot corner coordinates 10 5 95 95
multiplot scale factor 2
retain y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
ylimits 675 725
xlimits -1 1
major xtic mark number 2
minor xtic mark number 1
tic label size 2.2
label size 3
ylabel displacement 15
char circle
char size 3
char fill on
line dash
tic offset units screen
tic offset 10 10
.
dex mean interaction effects plot y x1 x2 subset batch = 1
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv DEXINT3.PS dexint3.ps
. quit
